Adaptations from prompt (rationale)
-----------------------------------

1. internal/ai/strategy/redactadapter/ (NEW SUBPACKAGE)
   Required to break the import cycle:
     provider → redact → strategy → provider
   redact MUST NOT import strategy. The adapter lives in a third
   package that imports both. Three lines of glue (Wrap, From,
   PolicyAdapter struct) plus a paired test file.

2. internal/ai/features/registry.go (REGISTRY ENTRY)
   Required because tools/aivet enforces that every /api/v1/ai/*
   route corresponds to a feature in the registry. The
   __redaction_bypass__ meta-feature mirrors the __usage__
   pattern from F3 — no per-feature toggle, gates only on
   ai_mode != 'off'.

3. internal/api/router.go (DECORATOR + MOUNT)
   Required to wire WithRedaction into the provider chain (the
   prompt is explicit: "the redactor sits in the decorator chain
   (P5) so every cloud call is sanitized by default"). Also mounts
   the admin route — the only sanctioned mount point per the F0
   contract enforced by aivet.

4. web/src/ai/features.ts (GENERATED)
   `aigen --check` failed after the registry change. Regenerated
   by `go run ./tools/aigen`. Pure mirror of registry.go — no
   hand edits.


